<title>MALAWI: SOCCER-MALAWI BEAT MAURITIUS IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALAWI BEAT MAURITIUS IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LILONGWE, Malawi 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malawi beat Mauritius</p>
<p>3-2 (halftime 1-0) in their African Nations Cup group seven</p>
<p>qualifying match on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malawi - John Maduka 19, 81, Hendrix Banda 76</p>
<p>Mauritius - Eric Philogene 87,James Pierre-Louis 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Malawi	    4   3   0   1   7   5    9</p>
<p> Zambia	    3   2   1   0   3   0    7</p>
<p> Mozambique	3   1   0   2   3   3    3</p>
<p> Mauritius	 4   0   1   3   3   8    1</p>
<p>Next match: Sunday - Mozambique v Zambia</p>
</text>
